Download Now Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY Georgia mobile app! Place order, get lots of rewards and special offers!

From this app you can easily:

•⁠  ⁠Place order ahead at preferred restaurant, while you are on the way and get your meal without standing in line. You can even schedule the order pickup time;
•⁠  ⁠Get reward points on every purchase you made through this app at every Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY restaurant;
•⁠  ⁠Exchange your reward points to various products which you can find in Wendy’s, DUNKIN' & SUBWAY gifts;
•⁠  ⁠Check-in daily and get different special offers tailored for you;
•⁠  ⁠Add your best pick products under “Favorite” tab and order easily;

Enjoy hole new experience with Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY Georgia loyalty app and please do share your feedback. 

Note: Reward scheme is common for all three brands. You can earn and exchange points from one another.

With the Zapp application, make your everyday life easier. Zapp enables easy ordering and fast food delivery. Choose your favorite restaurant and enjoy delicious dishes.

How to place an order with the Zapp application:
1. Register;
2. Specify your address;
3. Choose a restaurant or shop and choose a dish or groceries;
4. Choose the payment method (cash/card);
5. Follow the delivery driver live;
6. Rate the restaurant and the delivery driver;
7. Enjoy!

Advantages of the Zapp application:
1. Simple use of the application;
2. Real-time driver tracking;
3. Picking up an order in a restaurant/store;
4. The possibility of scheduling delivery for a certain time;
5. Card payment;
6. Actions and promotions;
7. Branded vehicles and professional drivers.

Our mission and vision are user-oriented, and we are constantly working to improve the service and the application because the user experience is very important to us.
